{"id":7632,"date":"2021-06-28T07:20:11","date_gmt":"2021-06-28T07:20:11","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?page_id=7632"},"modified":"2021-09-10T10:34:24","modified_gmt":"2021-09-10T10:34:24","slug":"caste-dotazy","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/caste-dotazy\/","title":{"rendered":"\u010cast\u00e9 dotazy"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"7632\" class=\"elementor elementor-7632\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-faf90f7 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"faf90f7\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-f9a471f\" data-id=\"f9a471f\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f10a6cc elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f10a6cc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">\u010cast\u00e9 ot\u00e1zky (FAQ)<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fee2bcb elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"fee2bcb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Obecn\u011b o molekulov\u00e9 spektroskopii<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-33d2c69 elementor-widget elementor-widget-accordion\" data-id=\"33d2c69\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-5431\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-5431\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">1.\tFT-IR, FT-NIR, Ramanova spektroskopie\u2026 Co to znamen\u00e1?<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-5431\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-5431\"><p>V\u0161echny tyto metody spo\u010d\u00edvaj\u00ed v\u00a0interakci vzorku s\u00a0elektromagnetick\u00fdm z\u00e1\u0159en\u00edm o jedn\u00e9 konkr\u00e9tn\u00ed vlnov\u00e9 d\u00e9lce (Ramanova spektroskopie) nebo v\u00a0dan\u00e9m intervalu (infra\u010derven\u00e1 spektroskopie) a mluv\u00edme o nich obecn\u011b jako o metod\u00e1ch molekulov\u00e9 spektroskopie. V\u00fdstupem t\u00e9to anal\u00fdzy je pak spektrum, kter\u00e9 je unik\u00e1tn\u00ed pro ka\u017edou slou\u010deninu, a z\u00a0jeho zm\u011bn lze krom\u011b jin\u00e9ho ur\u010dit i \u0159adu dal\u0161\u00edch fyzik\u00e1ln\u011b-chemick\u00fdch vlastnost\u00ed vzorku. Setkat se u n\u00e1s m\u016f\u017eete s <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/modelova-rada\/raman\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">klasickou i UV Ramanovou spektroskopi\u00ed<\/a>, infra\u010dervenou spektroskopi\u00ed v\u00a0bl\u00edzk\u00e9 (<a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/modelova-rada\/nir-spektrometry\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">NIR<\/a> nebo <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/modelova-rada\/nir-spektrometry\/\">FT-NIR<\/a>), st\u0159edn\u00ed (<a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/modelova-rada\/ftir-spektroskopie\/\">FT-IR<\/a>) nebo vzd\u00e1len\u00e9 (FAR-IR) oblasti \u010di <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/modelova-rada\/libs\/\">LIBS<\/a>. <\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-5432\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-5432\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">2.\tJak\u00fd typ anal\u00fdzy m\u016f\u017eu prov\u00e1d\u011bt?<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-5432\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-5432\"><p>Pomoc\u00ed Ramanov\u00fdch a infra\u010derven\u00fdch spektrometr\u016f lze prov\u00e1d\u011bt jak <strong>kvalitativn\u00ed<\/strong> anal\u00fdzu (<strong>identifikaci<\/strong> a <strong>verifikaci<\/strong> l\u00e1tek), tak i <strong>kvantitativn\u00ed<\/strong> m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed, a to v\u010detn\u011b <strong>anal\u00fdzy sm\u011bs\u00ed<\/strong>.<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-5433\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"3\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-5433\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">3.\tJak\u00e9 v\u00fdhody molekulov\u00e1 spektroskopie p\u0159in\u00e1\u0161\u00ed?<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-5433\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-5433\"><p>Molekulov\u00e1 spektroskopie je rychl\u00e1, spolehliv\u00e1, neinvazivn\u00ed metoda, kter\u00e1 nav\u00edc v\u011bt\u0161inou nevy\u017eaduje ani <strong>\u017e\u00e1dnou \u00fapravu vzorku<\/strong>. Ve v\u00fdsledku tak \u0161et\u0159\u00ed v\u00e1\u0161 \u010das, pen\u00edze i materi\u00e1l a anal\u00fdzu vzork\u016f m\u016f\u017eete prov\u00e1d\u011bt i bez hlubok\u00fdch znalost\u00ed.<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-5434\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"4\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-5434\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">4.\tV laborato\u0159i m\u00e1me Raman\u016fv spektrometr. Jak mi m\u016f\u017ee pomoci FT-IR spektrometr?<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-5434\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"4\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-5434\"><p>FT-IR a Ramanova spektroskopie jsou komplement\u00e1rn\u00ed metody, co\u017e znamen\u00e1, \u017ee vzorky, kter\u00e9 nejsou dob\u0159e m\u011b\u0159iteln\u00e9 pomoc\u00ed FT-IR spektroskopie, poskytuj\u00ed zpravidla siln\u00fd Raman\u016fv sign\u00e1l a naopak. Ramanova spektroskopie je vhodn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed nap\u0159. pro <strong>m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed vzork\u016f, kter\u00e9 obsahuj\u00ed vodu<\/strong>.<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-5435\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"5\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-5435\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">5.\tJak \u010dasto se metody molekulov\u00e9 spektroskopie vyu\u017e\u00edvaj\u00ed?<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-5435\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"5\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-5435\"><p>V sou\u010dasn\u00e9 dob\u011b se infra\u010derven\u00e1 i Ramanova spektroskopie vyu\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 ve v\u0161ech mo\u017en\u00fdch odv\u011btv\u00edch v\u011bdy, v\u00fdzkumu a pr\u016fmyslu, i slo\u017eky IZS jsou vybaveny ru\u010dn\u00edmi analyz\u00e1tory. V \u010cesk\u00e9 a Slovensk\u00e9 republice funguje ji\u017e v\u00edce ne\u017e <strong>650 na\u0161ich p\u0159\u00edstroj\u016f<\/strong>.<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-b30e162 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"b30e162\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-8a02ec2\" data-id=\"8a02ec2\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ecd250f elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"ecd250f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6NzU0NSwidG9nZ2xlIjpmYWxzZX0%3D\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Chci dost\u00e1vat novinky ze sv\u011bta molekulov\u00e9 spektroskopie!<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dbc8820 dce_masking-none elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"dbc8820\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/nanoram\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"565\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/7173d73b-768x565.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-image-5718\" alt=\"Ru\u010dn\u00ed Raman\u016fv spektrometr NanoRam\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/7173d73b-768x565.jpg 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/7173d73b-300x221.jpg 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/7173d73b-1024x753.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/7173d73b-1536x1130.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/7173d73b.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\">Ru\u010dn\u00ed Raman\u016fv spektrometr NanoRam<\/figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c16cf6c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c16cf6c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">O va\u0161\u00ed aplikaci a vzorc\u00edch<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c7e59d2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-accordion\" data-id=\"c7e59d2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-2091\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2091\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">1.\tJak\u00e9 vzorky m\u016f\u017eu m\u011b\u0159it?<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2091\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2091\"><p>Metodami molekulov\u00e9 spektroskopie m\u016f\u017eete analyzovat vzorky <strong>pevn\u00e9, kapaln\u00e9 i plynn\u00e9, pr\u00e1\u0161kov\u00e9, gelov\u00e9, mikroskopick\u00e9 i velk\u00e9 objekty<\/strong> (nap\u0159. n\u00e1st\u011bnn\u00e9 fresky), bu\u0148ky i anorganick\u00e9 vzorky a mnoho dal\u0161\u00edch. Mo\u017enosti t\u011bchto metod jsou vskutku obs\u00e1hl\u00e9.<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-2092\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2092\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">2.\tJak mal\u00e9 nebo velk\u00e9 vzorky lze m\u011b\u0159it?<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2092\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2092\"><p>Pomoc\u00ed na\u0161ich p\u0159\u00edstroj\u016f lze m\u011b\u0159it mikroskopick\u00e9 vzorky s\u00a0<strong>rozli\u0161en\u00edm od pouh\u00fdch 10 nm<\/strong> (bu\u0148ky, stopov\u00e1 mno\u017estv\u00ed l\u00e1tek\u2026) i rozm\u011brn\u00e9 vzorky, jako jsou <strong>n\u00e1st\u011bnn\u00e9 fresky nebo malby<\/strong>.<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-2093\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"3\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2093\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">3.\tPot\u0159ebuji analyzovat plynn\u00fd vzorek, je to mo\u017en\u00e9?<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2093\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2093\"><p>Ano! FT-IR i Ramanovy spektrometry lze vybavit plynov\u00fdmi celami, se kter\u00fdmi <strong>plynn\u00e9 vzorky<\/strong> m\u016f\u017eete analyzovat obdobn\u011b jako vzorky v\u00a0jin\u00fdch skupenstv\u00edch.<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-2094\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"4\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2094\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">4.\tMoje aplikace nen\u00ed ve va\u0161em seznamu. M\u016f\u017eu i tak n\u011bjak vyu\u017e\u00edt n\u011bkter\u00fd z p\u0159\u00edstroj\u016f?<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2094\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"4\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2094\"><p>Uveden\u00e9 aplikace jsou pouze skromn\u00fdm v\u00fdb\u011brem z\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/aplikace\/\"><strong>nep\u0159ebern\u00e9ho mno\u017estv\u00ed mo\u017enost\u00ed molekulov\u00e9 spektroskopie<\/strong><\/a>. Pokud v\u00e1s zaj\u00edm\u00e1, jak pomoc\u00ed n\u00ed m\u016f\u017eete sv\u016fj v\u00fdzkum, v\u00fdvoj nebo v\u00fdrobn\u00ed procesy posunout na dal\u0161\u00ed \u00farove\u0148, nev\u00e1hejte n\u00e1s kontaktovat, r\u00e1di v\u00e1m se v\u0161\u00edm porad\u00edme.<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-2095\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"5\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2095\" aria-expan