ddit n\u011bjak\u00e9 p\u0159\u00edslu\u0161enstv\u00ed?<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1784\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"4\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-1784\"><p>Ano! Ke v\u0161em spektrometr\u016fm nab\u00edz\u00edme \u0161irokou \u0161k\u00e1lu p\u0159\u00edslu\u0161enstv\u00ed: u\u017eivatelsky <strong>v\u00fdm\u011bnn\u00e9 lasery<\/strong>, <strong>filtry<\/strong> a <strong>m\u0159\u00ed\u017eky<\/strong>, r\u016fzn\u00e9 m\u011b\u0159ic\u00ed n\u00e1stavce pro <strong>m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed tablet, lahv\u00ed, vzork\u016f v\u00a0pytl\u00edch \u010di n\u00e1dr\u017e\u00edch, autosamplery, vl\u00e1knovou optiku, integra\u010dn\u00ed sf\u00e9ry<\/strong> a mnoh\u00e9 dal\u0161\u00ed v\u00a0z\u00e1vislosti na dan\u00e9m p\u0159\u00edstroji.<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-1785\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"5\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1785\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">5. Je mo\u017en\u00e9 kombinovat metody molekulov\u00e9 spektroskopie a jin\u00e9 m\u011b\u0159ic\u00ed techniky?<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1785\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"5\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-1785\"><p>Metody molekulov\u00e9 spektroskopie lze velmi dob\u0159e kombinovat s\u00a0celou \u0159adou technik: <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/raman-afm\/\">AFM<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/aplikace\/veda-vyzkum-skolstvi\/raman-sem-kombinovana-mikroskopie\/\">SEM<\/a>, TERS, <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/ftir-gc\/\">GC\/LC<\/a>, hmotnostn\u00ed spektroskopi\u00ed, <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/kombinace-ft-ir-a-reometru\/\">reometri\u00