ing-title elementor-size-default\">Na\u0161e podpora<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-45bc58a elementor-widget elementor-widget-accordion\" data-id=\"45bc58a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-7311\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-7311\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">1. M\u016f\u017eete mi poradit s mou aplikac\u00ed? <\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-7311\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-7311\"><p>Jist\u011b. Nedod\u00e1v\u00e1me pouze p\u0159\u00edstroj, ale z\u00e1le\u017e\u00ed n\u00e1m i na tom, abyste jej mohli ke sv\u00e9 pr\u00e1ci efektivn\u011b vyu\u017e\u00edt. Va\u0161i aplikaci s\u00a0v\u00e1mi probereme a se v\u0161\u00edm v\u00e1m porad\u00edme. Sou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed na\u0161\u00ed podpory je tak\u00e9 \u0159ada <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/skoleni-a-kurzy\/\">kurz\u016f<\/a><\/strong>, kde si m\u016f\u017eete prohloubit znalosti.<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-7312\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-7312\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">2. Nejsme \u00fapln\u011b rozhodnut\u00ed, zda chceme spektrometr. M\u016f\u017eete si vyzkou\u0161et n\u011bkter\u00fd ze spektrometr\u016f na na\u0161ich vzorc\u00edch?<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-7312\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-7312\"><p>Ano, bu\u010f n\u00e1m vzorky za\u0161lete, anebo se na n\u011bkter\u00e9 z\u00a0p\u0159\u00edstroj\u016f m\u016f\u017eete p\u0159ij\u00edt pod\u00edvat <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/o-nas\/kontakt\/\">osobn\u011b k n\u00e1m<\/a>. Nab\u00edz\u00edme tak\u00e9 mo\u017enost bezplatn\u00e9ho zap\u016fj\u010den\u00ed n\u011bkter\u00fdch spektrometr\u016f.<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-7313\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"3\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-7313\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">3. Jak n\u00e1kladn\u00fd je servis p\u0159\u00edstroj\u016f?<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-7313\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-7313\"><p>Ve\u0161ker\u00fd <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/aplikacni-podpora\/servis\/\">servis<\/a> u n\u00e1s zakoupen\u00fdch p\u0159\u00edstroj\u016f je <strong>zdarma<\/strong>, vy budete platit pouze cenu n\u00e1hradn\u00edch d\u00edl\u016f p\u0159i p\u0159\u00edpadn\u00e9 oprav\u011b.<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-7314\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"4\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-7314\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">4. Jak rychle p\u0159ijedete, kdy\u017e se p\u0159\u00edstroj porouch\u00e1?<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-7314\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"4\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-7314\"><p><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/o-nas\/kontakt\/\">S\u00eddl\u00edme v\u00a0Praze<\/a>, a jeliko\u017e m\u00e1me pln\u011b vybaven\u00fd sklad n\u00e1hradn\u00edch d\u00edl\u016f, m\u016f\u017eeme k\u00a0v\u00e1m p\u0159ijet tak\u0159ka okam\u017eit\u011b. V\u0161ichni na\u0161i technici jsou pro\u0161koleni v\u00fdrobci jednotliv\u00fdch spektrometr\u016f.<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-7315\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"5\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-7315\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">5. Nov\u00fd spektrometr je pro n\u00e1s moc drah\u00fd, existuje n\u011bjak\u00e1 levn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed varianta?<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-7315\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"5\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-7315\"><p>Pokud nechcete nebo nem\u016f\u017eete investovat do nov\u00e9ho p\u0159\u00edstroje, m\u016f\u017eete vyu\u017e\u00edt n\u011bkterou z\u00a0nab\u00eddek repasovan\u00fdch p\u0159\u00edstroj\u016f v\u00a0na\u0161em bazaru. <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/o-nas\/kontakt\/\">Kontaktujte n\u00e1s<\/a> a budeme se sna\u017eit v\u00e1m maxim\u00e1ln\u011b vyhov\u011bt.<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-7316\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"6\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-7316\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">6. Nic o molekulov\u00e9 spektroskopii nev\u00edm, kde se m\u016f\u017eu vzd\u011blat?<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-7316\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"6\" rol